cdu31ao:  Linux kernel version 1.1.18, with SCSI+IDE+Sony CDU31A CD support.
cdu31ao:
cdu31ao:  This is a Linux kernel with support for the Sony CDU31A CD-ROM
cdu31ao:  drives, as well as full support for SCSI devices such as hard drives,
cdu31ao:  tape drives, and SCSI CD-ROM drives. See the file 'cdu31a.log' for
cdu31ao:  an exact list of included drivers.
cdu31ao:
cdu31ao:  This kernel also has support for PPP, UMSDOS, CSLIP, ethernet,
cdu31ao:  Ftape, and the PS/2 style mouse (but not other busmouse types).
