sbpcdo:   Linux kernel version 1.1.18, with SCSI+IDE+SoundBlaster Pro CD
sbpcdo:   (also Panasonic/Lasermate).
sbpcdo:
sbpcdo:   This is a Linux kernel with support for the whole family of IDE-style
sbpcdo:   Kotobuki/Matsushita/Panasonic CR-5xx drives for SoundBlaster ('Pro' or
sbpcdo:   '16 ASP' or compatible) cards and for 'no-sound' interfaces like 
sbpcdo:   Lasermate and the Panasonic CI-101P.
sbpcdo:
sbpcdo:   This kernel also has support for PPP, UMSDOS, CSLIP, ethernet,
sbpcdo:   Ftape, and the PS/2 style mouse (but not other busmouse types).
